        "content": "feed-ingest runs as a host process (console on :8099). It has no cloud deployment by design, so this probe is its only signal.\n\nLogs from this host process are not shipped yet. docs/SPEC.md W2: host-process logs stay out until each is shown clean (their JSON formatters put the full traceback and every extra field on the line). See docs/REQUESTS.md \u00a73.",
